  "failure_conditions": [
    "A three-point face of some K_k whose frame holonomy is not trivial, or a corner whose label holonomy is not -1.",
    "A point z and cut star for which the developed constant-label state violates no line, more than one line, or a line missing z.",
    "A vortex step re-routed inside a ball that changes a colour outside the ball or yields an invalid state.",
    "A shortest cut star, with the vortex at distance >= 4 from the corners, from which some step to a neighbour has no re-routing inside radius 3 (within the tested k)."
